sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Client as ML Training Client<br/>(mlflow SDK)
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking Server<br/>5000/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP or 9000/TCP
    participant LLM as External LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OTEL as OpenTelemetry Collector

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Experiment Run Logging
        Client->>MLflow: POST /api/2.0/mlflow/runs/create<br/>Auth: kubernetes-auth token
        MLflow->>K8s: TokenReview (validate token)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>MLflow: Authentication result
        MLflow->>PostgreSQL: INSERT run metadata<br/>Auth: Username/password<br/>Encryption: Configurable TLS
        PostgreSQL-->>MLflow: Run ID
        MLflow-->>Client: Run ID response

        Client->>MLflow: POST /api/2.0/mlflow/runs/log-batch<br/>Params, metrics, tags
        MLflow->>PostgreSQL: INSERT params, metrics, tags
        PostgreSQL-->>MLflow: OK
        MLflow-->>Client: OK

        Client->>MLflow: PUT /api/2.0/mlflow-artifacts/artifacts<br/>Upload artifact
        MLflow->>S3: PUT object<br/>Auth: AWS IAM / Access Key<br/>Encryption: TLS 1.2+
        S3-->>MLflow: Upload confirmation
        MLflow-->>Client: Artifact stored
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,LLM: Flow 2: AI Gateway LLM Invocation
        Client->>MLflow: POST /gateway/{endpoint}/invocations<br/>Auth: kubernetes-auth token
        MLflow->>PostgreSQL: Lookup endpoint config + decrypt secret<br/>(AES-GCM with KEK)
        PostgreSQL-->>MLflow: Endpoint config + API key
        MLflow->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: API key (Bearer)<br/>Encryption: TLS 1.2+
        LLM-->>MLflow: LLM response
        MLflow-->>Client: Gateway response<br/>(rate limited, guardrails applied)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Client,PostgreSQL: Flow 3: OpenTelemetry Trace Ingestion
        Client->>MLflow: POST /otel/v1/traces<br/>OTLP HTTP payload<br/>Auth: kubernetes-auth token
        MLflow->>PostgreSQL: INSERT trace_info, spans<br/>Auth: Username/password
        PostgreSQL-->>MLflow: Trace stored
        MLflow-->>Client: OK

        opt Trace export enabled
            MLflow->>OTEL: Export traces (OTLP HTTP)<br/>Configurable endpoint
        end
    end
